  "prefLabel": "Rev 801.11 State of New Hampshire",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 801.11 “State of New Hampshire” means the state as an entity, all of the various agencies of the state, all of the various political subdivisions of the state including the various districts such as village, school, or water districts.\n\nSource. #10665, eff 9-9-14 (from Rev 801.08); renumbered by #11005 (formerly Rev 801.10); ss by #14071, eff 9-10-24",
